# P&L Period Excel vs Transaction History

## Invariant

**Export Business Only (P&L Period)** is the same window as the P&L banner + History (bank ∩ dates + Cash Expense). Spreadsheet cells must match on-screen **text**: AU date `DD/MM/YYYY`, `getTransactionCategoryLabel`, `cleanTransactionDescription`, Company/Personal department names, debit/credit amounts.

## Do

- Filter dates with `filterTransactionsForDateRange` / `toIsoDateString` (DD/MM/YYYY still counts).
- Exclude `personal` / `unknown` for Business Only — same gate as `calculateBusinessMetrics`. Do **not** remap personal → Company before that filter.
- Put the selected period on row 1 of the workbook **and** in the filename.
- GST: tagged FREE/EXCLUDED = 0; cash default GST-free; bank default inclusive ÷11.

## Do not

- Compare dates with `slice(0, 10)` on display strings.
- Keep a second category/description map in `excel-export`.
- Export the whole statement PDF span when a P&L banner range is set.
